<title>HONG KONG: CIBC sets warrants on Taiwan electronic shr basket.</title>
<headline>CIBC sets warrants on Taiwan electronic shr basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce (CIBC) said on Wednesday it issued 10 million American-style call warrants on a basket of five Taiwanese Electronic stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Taiwan Liteon Electronic Co  0.1 shares</p>
<p> D-Link Corp			0.1 shares</p>
<p> Delta Electronic		 0.1 shares</p>
<p> Hon Hai Precision Industry   0.1 shares</p>
<p> Elite Computer Systems	 0.1 shares</p>
<p>	     One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$0.8872     PREMIUM	 18.33 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$0.16263    GEARING	 5.455x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  01.OCT.97     PAYDATE	 TO BE ANNOUNCED</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG    MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p>INITIAL BASKET VALUE  US$0.8872</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
